---
import ComplianceNote from '../../../components/compliance/ComplianceNote.astro';
import CTASection from '../../../components/cta/CTASection.astro';
import HeroSplit from '../../../components/sections/HeroSplit.astro';
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const qualityPrinciples = [
  'Careful Plant Selection',
  'Global Network',
  'High Quality Standards',
  'Extensive Quality Testing',
  'Focus on Purity',
  'Transparency',
];

const sourcingPrinciples = [
  'Collaboration with Farmers Worldwide',
  'Long-Term Partnerships',
  'Fair Payment',
  'Sustainable Cultivation',
  'Support for Local Communities',
];

const productAreas = [
  'Single Essential Oils',
  'Essential Oil Blends',
  'Nutritional Supplements',
  'Personal Care',
  'Spa & Skincare',
  'Home',
  'Wellness Systems',
];

const accountDetails = [
  'Official Customer Account Directly with doTERRA',
  'Personal Point of Contact',
  'Products at Wholesale Pricing with a 25% Saving Compared with the Regular Retail Price',
  'No Obligation to Buy',
  'No Subscription Required',
  'You Decide for Yourself',
];
import '../../../styles/doterra-understanding-refined.css';
---


<PageLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Understanding doTERRA | Products, Account & Getting Started | Kyle Oils"
  description="Learn what doTERRA is, which product areas are available, how the customer account works and how personal guidance can help you begin."
>
  <HeroSplit
    title="Understanding doTERRA"
    primaryHref="/en/starter-sets/"
    primaryLabel="Compare Starter Kits"
    secondaryHref="/en/knowledge/products-systems/doterra-customer-account-explained-simply/"
    secondaryLabel="Understand Customer Accounts"
    imageSrc="/assets/images/nature/nature-heath-hero-01.png"
    imageAlt="Lüneburg Heath in warm light"
    imageWidth={1672}
    imageHeight={941}
    imagePosition="56% center"
    imageSources={[
      { type: 'image/avif', srcset: '/assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-640.avif 640w, /assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-960.avif 960w, /assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-1280.avif 1280w, /assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-1672.avif 1672w' },
      { type: 'image/webp', srcset: '/assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-640.webp 640w, /assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-960.webp 960w, /assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-1280.webp 1280w, /assets/images/optimized/nature-heath-hero-01-1672.webp 1672w' },
    ]}
  >
    <p>Perhaps you have heard of doTERRA and would like to better understand what the company stands for.</p>
    <p>This page offers a straightforward overview, without sales pressure or complicated technical terms.</p>
  </HeroSplit>

  <section class="section dt-overview" aria-labelledby="dt-overview-title">
    <div class="container dt-wrap dt-overview__layout" data-reveal>
      <div class="dt-overview__heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">GET TO KNOW THE BRAND</p>
        <h2 id="dt-overview-title">The idea behind doTERRA.</h2>
        <p>Before choosing an oil or starter kit, it helps to understand who makes the products and what the company stands for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dt-overview__panel">
        <p>doTERRA is an international wellness company with a focus on essential oils. Its name means “gift of the Earth”.</p>
        <ul><li>Founded in 2008</li><li>International company</li><li>Essential oils & wellness</li></ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dt-quality" aria-labelledby="dt-quality-title">
    <div class="container dt-wrap">
      <header class="dt-heading" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">QUALITY & TESTING</p>
        <h2 id="dt-quality-title">Why quality matters.</h2>
        <p>doTERRA describes a multi-step approach, from selecting plants to testing the final oils. These principles reflect the company’s stated priorities.</p>
      </header>
      <ol class="dt-quality__grid" data-consultation-cards>
        {qualityPrinciples.map((principle,index)=><li class="dt-quality__card" data-consultation-card>
          <span class="dt-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>
          <h3>{principle}</h3>
        </li>)}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dt-sourcing" aria-labelledby="dt-sourcing-title">
    <div class="container dt-wrap">
      <div class="dt-sourcing__panel" data-reveal>
        <div class="dt-sourcing__copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">SOURCING & RESPONSIBILITY</p>
          <h2 id="dt-sourcing-title">Where the botanicals come from.</h2>
          <p>Co-Impact Sourcing® is doTERRA’s sourcing model, focused on longer-term relationships with growers and communities. Sustainability is an important aim of the approach.</p>
          <span class="dt-sourcing__tag">Co-Impact Sourcing®</span>
          <p class="dt-sourcing__note">Specific growing methods and projects vary by region, plant and local partnership.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="dt-sourcing__list">
          {sourcingPrinciples.map((principle,index)=><li>
            <span class="dt-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>
            <span>{principle}</span>
          </li>)}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dt-products" aria-labelledby="dt-products-title">
    <div class="container dt-wrap">
      <header class="dt-heading" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT RANGE</p>
        <h2 id="dt-products-title">Beyond individual essential oils.</h2>
        <p>From single oils to everyday routines: explore the product categories and learn how to use products responsibly before getting started.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="dt-products__grid" data-consultation-cards>
        {productAreas.map((area,index)=><article class="dt-products__card" data-consultation-card>
          <span class="dt-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>
          <h3>{area}</h3>
        </article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dt-account" aria-labelledby="dt-account-title">
    <div class="container dt-wrap dt-account__layout" data-reveal>
      <div class="dt-account__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">YOUR CUSTOMER ACCOUNT</p>
        <h2 id="dt-account-title">Your choice, your starting point.</h2>
        <p>Official customer accounts are held directly with doTERRA. You decide whether, when and what you want to order.</p>
        <p class="dt-account__note">The 25% wholesale price advantage is relative to the regular retail price for eligible customers. It is not an additional discount on a displayed wholesale or kit price. Terms can vary by market.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="dt-account__list">
        {accountDetails.map((detail,index)=><li>
          <span class="dt-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index+1).padStart(2,"0")}</span>
          <span>{detail}</span>
        </li>)}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section dt-support" aria-labelledby="dt-support-title">
    <div class="container dt-wrap">
      <div class="dt-support__panel" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL GUIDANCE</p>
          <h2 id="dt-support-title">One point of contact. Even after your order.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="dt-support__text"><p>I am not the manufacturer and I am not here to push products. I listen, answer your questions and help you explore responsible use and simple routines.</p><p>You do not need to navigate every option alone. Together we can find a sensible place to begin.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection
    title="Your next step: explore or ask."
    primaryHref="/en/knowledge/"
    primaryLabel="Explore the Knowledge Hub"
    secondaryHref="/en/contact/"
    secondaryLabel="Talk with Kyle"
  >
    <p>Keep learning at your own pace or send me a message. We can work out what information or products are relevant to you.</p>
  </CTASection>

  <section class="compliance-section dt-compliance">
    <div class="container">
      <ComplianceNote label="Important note">
        <p class="dt-compliance__label">Important note</p>
        <p>My guidance is not a substitute for medical diagnosis or treatment. I do not make healing or medical treatment claims.</p>
      </ComplianceNote>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline src="/scripts/consultation-motion.js" defer></script>
</PageLayout>
